<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Jan 14.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Jan 14.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Monday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Consol Rutile	 190.59    0.85</p>
<p> 2   Hills Inds	     15.29    1.70</p>
<p> 3   Telecasters Nqld     15.24    5.25</p>
<p> 4   Schroder Intl	  10.46    2.30</p>
<p> 5   Prime Credit Tr	10.00    0.98</p>
<p> 6   Aust Tour		 9.87    0.76</p>
<p> 7   Indu Property	   9.78    0.93</p>
